---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout description="Olabode Anise leads data science teams and writes about security, data, and technology.">
  <PageHero title="A problem solver who crafts end-to-end solutions and tells stories with data." />

  <section class="site-container pb-20">
    <div class="grid gap-7 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-primary-muted)]">
      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">Hi, I’m Olabode (O-lah-boh-dey) Anise (Uh-nee-shey) &#128075;. </strong><br />
        I'm based out of San Francisco. I currently work on agentic coding solutions as a Data Scientist at OpenAI.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]"> I'm a Data Scientst who enjoys building for others. </strong><br />
        I pride myself on being a Data Scientist who builds products and platforms for customers and team members. 
        I get joy from landing changes in production and seeing the solutions I helped build solve problems for others. 
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">I care about work that makes technology more accessible and easy to understand.</strong><br />
        From graduate school to now, my career has been focused on making easy for everyone to take advantage of new and complex technologies whether 
        that is design, security, or AI.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">Outside of work, I spend time reading, traveling, and watching sports.</strong><br />
        The Steelers, Auburn Tigers, and Phoenix Suns have brought me immense amounts of joy and also taken years off my life.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
